WEBVTT

01:02.604 --> 01:05.304
IDEAS OF HUMAN NATURE

01:13.174 --> 01:15.244
RESUME

01:33.014 --> 01:40.114
HEAR ME: OUR SUMMER

01:49.944 --> 01:50.944
Do it.

01:51.504 --> 01:52.604
No, I don't want to.

01:53.144 --> 01:54.144
Just do it.

01:59.144 --> 02:03.104
I'll just get a job, mom

02:06.504 --> 02:07.274
With this resume?

02:07.274 --> 02:08.574
RESUME

02:08.774 --> 02:09.774
Yeah.

02:10.104 --> 02:11.574
Where?

02:12.144 --> 02:13.304
Somewhere else.

02:15.944 --> 02:19.404
For now... I want...

02:19.844 --> 02:22.474
You just want to do nothing, right?

02:23.074 --> 02:24.074
Maybe?

02:24.344 --> 02:27.804
You don't know what
you want to do yet.

02:28.204 --> 02:29.044
For now, just do it.

02:29.174 --> 02:31.344
But not here, mom.

02:31.344 --> 02:33.144
Can't you go with your major?

02:33.944 --> 02:35.444
Who wants a philosophy major?

02:35.604 --> 02:36.604
Philosophy major?

02:40.544 --> 02:41.584
How about a public servant?

02:42.204 --> 02:43.344
It's a stable job

02:43.944 --> 02:45.174
It doesn't suit me.

02:45.644 --> 02:46.904
What suits you then?

02:47.104 --> 02:49.199
That's what I need to figure out..

02:50.374 --> 02:52.044
From now on... eagerly...

02:52.874 --> 02:54.204
Eagerly my foot!.

02:56.004 --> 02:57.104
You work here from today!

02:57.304 --> 02:58.304
Mom...

02:58.314 --> 02:59.844
Just for three months.

02:59.844 --> 03:02.040
Eagerly find your job
while working here.

03:05.644 --> 03:07.084
I will raise your allowance.

03:07.144 --> 03:09.404
Hurry up, deliveries piled up!

03:12.204 --> 03:13.204
Just go.

03:25.244 --> 03:27.844
Mom, What's that?

03:28.204 --> 03:30.644
Who put that hideous
thing on my scooter?

03:31.474 --> 03:32.474
I did.

03:32.544 --> 03:35.004
My scooter's not for delivery.

03:35.404 --> 03:38.204
It is now. Go deliver now!

03:46.775 --> 03:49.762
MI-JEONG'S LUNCHBOX

03:53.804 --> 03:54.719
What do you think?

03:54.744 --> 03:55.744
RICE LUNCH BOX

03:56.174 --> 03:57.174
Good.

03:57.304 --> 03:59.237
Good? Really?

04:02.574 --> 04:04.444
Did I do good?

04:05.404 --> 04:07.574
Good job, my boy!

04:15.974 --> 04:18.544
Should've asked me before...

04:54.604 --> 04:56.074
Do you know where the pool is?

04:59.144 --> 05:01.504
I can't hear.

05:05.604 --> 05:08.644
I didn't expect this
skill to come in handy.

05:14.644 --> 05:16.644
Swimming pool.

05:18.774 --> 05:20.474
Where is it?

05:21.404 --> 05:22.604
The entrance.

05:28.274 --> 05:29.774
Thank you.

05:29.774 --> 05:30.974
Goodbye.

06:28.574 --> 06:30.744
Ga-eul, finally under 30 seconds.

06:30.744 --> 06:33.044
- Really?
- You made it.

06:43.744 --> 06:45.104
You broke your record.

06:45.104 --> 06:46.404
I'm the best.

06:46.404 --> 06:47.404
Such a show off.

06:56.904 --> 06:59.104
I need to go! I'm late for work.

06:59.574 --> 07:04.344
Let me know if any
orders are missing.

07:07.044 --> 07:09.574
Let me check.

07:18.004 --> 07:20.204
It's all good, Have a nice day.

07:36.974 --> 07:38.874
Hi.

07:39.774 --> 07:41.074
Hi.

07:42.044 --> 07:43.704
I was

07:43.704 --> 07:45.174
over there

07:45.174 --> 07:46.704
delivering.

07:47.644 --> 07:48.704
I saw you.

07:52.974 --> 07:56.004
That person.

07:57.004 --> 08:00.344
Is she a swimmer, too?

08:01.344 --> 08:02.344
Who?

08:02.344 --> 08:08.074
She was walking with a stopwatch.

08:08.074 --> 08:10.074
She was with you.

08:10.074 --> 08:11.074
No, she is not a swimmer.

08:11.544 --> 08:12.644
Is she your friend?

08:12.644 --> 08:14.944
No, she is my older sister.

08:15.444 --> 08:18.274
And... name?

08:19.204 --> 08:21.204
Are you trying to pick her up?

08:22.644 --> 08:24.874
No, no.

08:26.174 --> 08:27.674
Well...

08:28.544 --> 08:30.404
Kind of.

08:32.704 --> 08:34.744
My name? Or my sister's?

08:35.174 --> 08:36.844
Your sister.

08:36.844 --> 08:39.804
No, I mean both.

08:40.404 --> 08:42.104
Both...

08:42.104 --> 08:44.104
Are you flirting with both of us?

08:44.744 --> 08:46.774
No, no, no.

08:56.604 --> 08:58.904
My name is Seo Ga-eul.

08:58.904 --> 09:00.744
This is my sign name.

09:01.904 --> 09:04.204
My sister name is Seo Yeo-reum.

09:04.204 --> 09:06.204
And her sign name.

09:07.704 --> 09:09.744
Phone number...

09:10.304 --> 09:14.174
Your sister's?

09:19.744 --> 09:22.544
Ask her yourself.

09:36.044 --> 09:37.344
I'm back.

09:38.374 --> 09:40.044
- Welcome back.
- Good work.

09:40.744 --> 09:41.744
Wait a minute.

09:52.044 --> 09:53.404
- Mom.
- Yeah?

09:54.044 --> 09:56.304
- Is that for delivery?
-Yes.

09:56.504 --> 09:58.204
I'll go.

10:14.044 --> 10:16.374
- Delivery.
- Thank you so much.

10:50.174 --> 10:51.844
Hi.

10:54.074 --> 10:55.974
Swimming pool...

10:56.404 --> 10:57.404
Delivery.

11:03.404 --> 11:06.074
Hi.

11:07.244 --> 11:09.244
Can I take a look?

11:09.704 --> 11:11.404
I'm a master of none,

11:11.404 --> 11:13.174
but jack of all trades.

11:16.004 --> 11:17.674
Yes, if it doesn't bother you.

11:32.444 --> 11:35.574
This is carburetor engine

11:35.574 --> 11:38.844
Old oil makes dirt pile up inside.

11:38.844 --> 11:40.844
After cleaning, it should be okay

11:40.844 --> 11:41.974
Thank you.

11:41.974 --> 11:44.044
Does it take long?

11:44.274 --> 11:45.774
About an hour?

11:45.774 --> 11:47.604
We can't do it here.

11:49.004 --> 11:50.504
Are you in a hurry?

11:57.304 --> 12:00.404
Then take mine.

12:00.404 --> 12:02.304
I will fix this up.

12:02.304 --> 12:03.874
You don't need to!

12:03.874 --> 12:05.244
You must be busy...

12:05.544 --> 12:06.644
No!

12:06.644 --> 12:11.474
Use mine. Let's meet
and exchange later.

12:17.174 --> 12:18.804
Thank you.

12:30.574 --> 12:31.644
No...

12:31.904 --> 12:33.674
We need to change scooters.

12:34.074 --> 12:36.544
Give me your phone,
I will give you my number.

12:36.944 --> 12:37.944
My bad.

12:49.504 --> 12:51.104
Don't forget to text me.

12:51.104 --> 12:52.104
Okay.

13:08.074 --> 13:09.074
Fix this up.

13:09.674 --> 13:12.044
What's this Vespa knock off?

13:12.744 --> 13:15.574
Engine is dirty and
coil doesn't look good either

13:15.744 --> 13:16.644
Yeah.

13:20.544 --> 13:22.404
Pad needs replacement, too.

13:23.304 --> 13:25.344
- You can fix it up, right?
- Of course, I can.

13:25.804 --> 13:28.364
Tomorrow?

13:29.344 --> 13:30.344
Tomorrow.

13:30.504 --> 13:32.274
Early morning.

13:33.174 --> 13:35.174
- You need it fast?
- Yeah very.

13:36.294 --> 13:39.744
And, make it like brand new.

13:40.544 --> 13:41.544
Bye.

13:42.544 --> 13:45.044
- Hey.
- Yeah?

13:45.644 --> 13:46.644
What's up?

13:48.704 --> 13:49.904
Something's up.

13:50.304 --> 13:51.474
- What?
- What is it?

13:51.744 --> 13:52.474
Nothing.

13:52.744 --> 13:53.974
There's something.

13:54.544 --> 13:55.674
Yes but no.

13:57.474 --> 13:59.508
There is something for sure.

14:05.244 --> 14:10.204
SCOOTER WILL BE FIXED
BY TOMORROW MORNING

14:10.204 --> 14:17.104
WHERE AND WHEN SHOULD WE MEET?

14:17.144 --> 14:17.744
Hey!

14:18.144 --> 14:19.844
- Goofing around again!
- You surprised me!

14:19.844 --> 14:20.844
Go deliver.

14:21.844 --> 14:23.074
Why me?

14:23.074 --> 14:25.644
Mom told me to, and I tell you to.

14:25.804 --> 14:27.074
Your scooter color changed?

14:33.544 --> 14:38.344
Where do you want to go by plane?

14:41.774 --> 14:43.704
To Olympics.

14:44.504 --> 14:49.074
I want to go to the
Olympics with my sister.

14:49.844 --> 14:50.974
That's great.

14:50.974 --> 14:52.544
Thank you.

14:58.344 --> 15:00.404
SCOOTER WILL BE FIXED
BY TOMORROW MORNING

15:00.404 --> 15:02.844
ARE YOU BUSY?

15:02.844 --> 15:05.004
PLEASE TEXT ME BACK.

15:05.044 --> 15:07.074
YEO-REUM?!

15:12.804 --> 15:16.174
Hey, this isn't
your house, you know.

15:16.174 --> 15:17.974
Home became work now

15:17.999 --> 15:21.344
and I need some rest.

15:23.604 --> 15:26.644
You are going to
keep doing delivery?

15:27.044 --> 15:28.574
For now, yeah.

15:29.674 --> 15:31.544
I should help them out,

15:31.844 --> 15:33.474
while I think things through.

15:33.544 --> 15:34.174
Yeah,

15:34.504 --> 15:37.944
Save up now and you'll be off the hook.

15:39.004 --> 15:40.304
Did you fix the scooter?

15:41.904 --> 15:44.204
All fixed up.
Take it when you leave.

15:45.604 --> 15:48.644
Who has your scooter then?

15:54.804 --> 15:56.624
Who is it?

15:58.714 --> 16:00.874
I don't really want to know.

16:01.574 --> 16:02.574
For real.

16:10.304 --> 16:12.204
You look like a fool.

16:14.374 --> 16:15.544
What's that?

16:16.044 --> 16:17.604
You do delivery, too?

16:17.604 --> 16:20.104
My scooter broke so I borrowed it.

16:20.104 --> 16:21.474
Mine is shabby.

16:22.774 --> 16:23.944
Aren't you tired?

16:24.274 --> 16:26.404
You broke a record today.

16:27.004 --> 16:29.474
Not tired at all.

16:30.804 --> 16:33.244
How's international sign language lesson?

16:33.574 --> 16:35.274
It's so hard for me.

16:35.444 --> 16:37.144
It's confusing.

16:37.144 --> 16:39.444
But I can learn it quickly,

16:39.444 --> 16:41.444
to go to Olympics with you.

16:43.144 --> 16:45.574
The Olympics is just a dream.

16:45.574 --> 16:48.014
Getting into the qualifiers
is already a win.

16:48.204 --> 16:51.044
You can make it to the Olympics.

16:51.044 --> 16:52.304
Okay.

16:53.644 --> 16:54.674
I'm serious,

16:54.674 --> 16:56.844
Fine. Let's go. I'm hungry.

16:57.544 --> 16:59.144
You are not listening to me?

16:59.404 --> 17:01.404
I'm half listening.

17:02.474 --> 17:03.604
You little...

18:11.944 --> 18:13.230
PLEASE TEXT ME BACK

18:13.255 --> 18:15.330
YEO-REUM?! HELLO??

18:15.355 --> 18:16.985
SCOOTER IS ALL FIXED?! HEY!!

18:17.010 --> 18:18.670
ARE YOU A THIEF?!!

18:22.904 --> 18:26.644
SORRY, I WAS BUSY YESTERDAY...

18:27.044 --> 18:28.944
THAT'S FINE.
SCOOTER IS ALL FIXED!

18:29.644 --> 18:32.274
REALLY? THANK YOU SO MUCH

18:33.804 --> 18:36.174
Scooter owner?

18:37.244 --> 18:37.774
A girl?

18:38.144 --> 18:39.544
WHEN SHOULD WE MEET?

18:39.674 --> 18:40.674
Wow, a girl.

18:42.374 --> 18:43.374
Is she pretty?

18:43.704 --> 18:44.404
Hold on.

18:44.474 --> 18:46.874
- Is she pretty?
- Hold on.

18:46.904 --> 18:48.604
HOW ABOUT AT 10?

18:48.604 --> 18:50.974
LET'S MEET AT THAT ALLEY

18:54.844 --> 18:56.304
What's so funny?

18:56.904 --> 18:58.544
It's nothing, let's eat.

19:21.374 --> 19:24.044
Done. It's perfect.

19:34.344 --> 19:37.644
"Lee-Yong-Jun"

20:08.204 --> 20:09.774
It's so clean like brand new.

20:10.204 --> 20:14.804
I washed it this morning.

20:15.144 --> 20:16.644
Thank you.

20:17.004 --> 20:19.074
How much for the repair?

20:19.404 --> 20:21.404
No need. It was a simple fix.

20:21.744 --> 20:22.874
But...

20:27.204 --> 20:28.504
It's really okay.

20:30.804 --> 20:31.804
I am

20:31.814 --> 20:33.804
26 years old.

20:33.974 --> 20:35.344
You?

20:36.504 --> 20:38.174
I'm also 26 years old.

20:38.574 --> 20:39.904
Great.

20:41.174 --> 20:45.474
Instead of the repair fee

20:47.144 --> 20:48.974
how about we just be friends?

20:51.404 --> 20:52.404
Why?

20:54.344 --> 20:57.244
Sign language doesn't have
honorific tense anyways.

20:57.704 --> 21:00.804
We spoke like friends already.

21:02.304 --> 21:03.544
Is that okay?

21:10.274 --> 21:13.974
Your sign name matches you.

21:16.104 --> 21:18.774
I'm not a strange person.

21:18.774 --> 21:20.444
Yesterday,

21:20.444 --> 21:23.974
I asked your sister about you.

21:24.604 --> 21:27.044
I wanted to be friends with you.

21:27.274 --> 21:29.104
I'm sorry.

21:29.104 --> 21:30.574
That's okay.

21:31.344 --> 21:36.004
That's why your
sign name is 'smile'.

21:38.274 --> 21:40.304
I don't even know your name.

21:40.844 --> 21:45.374
My name is Yong-jun.

21:46.804 --> 21:48.804
My sign name is...

21:50.344 --> 21:51.344
This.

21:51.874 --> 21:53.964
Because you like to take pictures?

21:54.274 --> 21:58.174
Take a picture of
my face and save it?

22:01.004 --> 22:07.304
Now that we are friends..

22:07.804 --> 22:11.244
- Shall-we grab a bite?
-  A bite?

22:11.244 --> 22:13.544
Or rather...

22:14.044 --> 22:16.544
ice coffee?

22:16.944 --> 22:20.344
You fixed my scooter. My treat

22:21.004 --> 22:24.004
Thank you.

23:12.104 --> 23:14.544
Sorry. I have to run.

23:15.204 --> 23:17.904
Give me. Let me throw it out.

23:18.474 --> 23:19.304
Is it okay?

23:19.314 --> 23:20.604
It's okay.

23:23.144 --> 23:24.304
Thanks.

23:31.444 --> 23:34.774
Busy all the time?

23:35.644 --> 23:39.004
A little? Studying
and part-time job.

23:40.574 --> 23:43.574
Studying... and part-time job.

23:49.174 --> 23:50.674
See you later.

24:14.144 --> 24:15.274
Is he seeing someone?

24:16.370 --> 24:19.144
Oh. Who?

24:19.774 --> 24:21.104
How would I know?

24:22.844 --> 24:24.074
It better not be Jae-jin

24:25.004 --> 24:27.204
What-the...

24:39.104 --> 24:41.214
DID YOU EAT LUNCH?

24:43.834 --> 24:45.804
HAVING A SANDWICH AT A CONVENIENCE STORE

24:45.934 --> 24:50.704
YOU SHOULD HAVE A PROPER MEAL

24:53.974 --> 24:55.404
Beer time, dude

24:57.374 --> 24:58.944
Hello! I'm here.

25:00.804 --> 25:01.804
What's he doing?

25:03.744 --> 25:06.074
Look at him.
He is making all this fuss.

25:17.774 --> 25:18.774
Why?

25:20.004 --> 25:21.004
It's surprisingly good.

25:21.844 --> 25:23.104
- Really?
-Yes.

25:24.274 --> 25:25.274
It's good.

25:26.104 --> 25:29.544
He should really work
here than getting a job.

25:29.704 --> 25:30.704
Right?

25:31.444 --> 25:33.804
Honey, let's employ him full-time.

25:34.204 --> 25:35.274
Shush.

25:37.474 --> 25:39.404
This is so much.

25:39.604 --> 25:42.544
I didn't know what you like.

25:42.544 --> 25:44.944
So, I put a little bit of everything.

25:44.944 --> 25:46.604
I like all these.

25:46.604 --> 25:47.774
Really?

25:49.044 --> 25:50.404
I'm so relieved.

25:58.574 --> 26:01.304
Go on and eat.

26:08.904 --> 26:09.904
How is it?

26:12.144 --> 26:13.144
Really?

26:16.904 --> 26:18.044
Let's eat together.

26:18.404 --> 26:21.774
I can eat at the store.

26:23.574 --> 26:24.904
Thank you for the meal.

26:25.404 --> 26:27.044
Enjoy your food.

26:35.344 --> 26:37.304
Take your time.

26:41.544 --> 26:44.374
How much is it?

26:44.374 --> 26:46.674
You don't have to pay.

26:46.674 --> 26:49.674
I can't do that.
You sell these lunchboxes.

26:56.474 --> 26:58.104
Is this enough?

27:06.544 --> 27:08.944
Thank you. It was delicious.

27:12.044 --> 27:14.904
I ate it. I should
take care of it.

27:19.374 --> 27:20.474
Bye.

27:29.874 --> 27:31.544
Not here to sell.

27:37.544 --> 27:38.544
I'm back.

27:41.404 --> 27:42.774
Sold a lot today.

27:43.604 --> 27:44.944
- You.
- What?

27:45.574 --> 27:47.444
Why did you cook all of a sudden?

27:50.144 --> 27:51.144
No reason.

27:52.644 --> 27:54.504
You are really going to
work here for ever?

27:54.544 --> 27:55.544
No.

27:56.074 --> 27:59.104
But that's not a bad idea.

27:59.144 --> 28:03.004
No. You'll work here only for
3 months and then find a job.

28:03.757 --> 28:10.674
That was the plan,
but I can help out more.

28:10.674 --> 28:11.674
We don't need help.

28:12.704 --> 28:14.444
So, stay out of kitchen.

28:14.604 --> 28:17.744
You were the one
forcing me to work here.

28:26.104 --> 28:27.104
Who is it?

28:33.374 --> 28:34.674
Ah, it's a friend.

28:35.074 --> 28:36.144
I'm heading out.

28:42.304 --> 28:43.544
Definitely a girl.

28:43.804 --> 28:44.804
Girl?

28:45.404 --> 28:47.274
Girl.

28:47.804 --> 28:48.804
Who?

28:49.544 --> 28:50.604
Yong-jun.

28:50.644 --> 28:53.644
Yong-jun is pretty for
a boy, but not a girl.

28:53.644 --> 28:57.004
I mean he is seeing a 'girl'.

28:57.044 --> 28:58.774
He is in love.

29:19.704 --> 29:22.904
GA-EUL'S TRAINING FEE
500,000 WON BY JULY 25

29:35.174 --> 29:39.480
25TH SEOUL CITY HALL SWIMMING COMPETITION

29:39.505 --> 29:41.198
LET'S GO, GA-EUL

29:47.374 --> 29:51.127
- Get out of the pool.
- You! Get out of the pool.

29:52.704 --> 29:55.244
How can our kids use
the same pool with them?

29:55.244 --> 29:56.244
It's ridiculous.

29:57.844 --> 30:00.374
- Can't you speak?
- You either?

30:00.374 --> 30:03.004
- Bring your coach here now.
- Are you swearing at me right now?

30:03.044 --> 30:04.274
You all get out!

30:08.304 --> 30:09.574
What's going on here?

30:11.674 --> 30:14.144
Are you the coach?

30:14.304 --> 30:15.304
Any problem?

30:15.344 --> 30:16.974
Empty the pool. Our
kids need to practice.

30:17.144 --> 30:19.374
This is our scheduled time.

30:19.404 --> 30:21.004
Our kids are scheduled, too.

30:21.044 --> 30:23.704
You are supposed to
use the outside lanes.

30:23.844 --> 30:24.874
How can our kids
swim with disabled kids?

30:24.874 --> 30:25.654
Are you alright? Let's get out.

30:25.654 --> 30:27.424
I'm fine.

30:27.484 --> 30:30.644
- What if our kids get sick?
- Why would they get sick?!

30:30.804 --> 30:33.074
No one has skin disease.

30:33.074 --> 30:34.444
Non-sense.

30:35.274 --> 30:38.299
We will come back later.
Clean up and bleach all.

30:38.324 --> 30:39.474
What did you say?

30:39.474 --> 30:41.804
Clean up everything with bleach.

30:41.804 --> 30:42.974
Disinfect it all

30:42.974 --> 30:44.704
You don't have manners.

30:44.944 --> 30:46.544
Ji-Kyung, get changed.

30:46.544 --> 30:48.774
Hey, let's go.

30:49.974 --> 30:51.304
Take care.

30:51.744 --> 30:53.074
See you later.

30:59.304 --> 31:01.744
- Hey.
- What is it?

31:02.274 --> 31:05.474
Deaf can read faces and lips.

31:05.674 --> 31:06.744
So what?

31:07.374 --> 31:10.844
We can hear. Deaf can see.

31:11.444 --> 31:14.804
They can't hear, but
can see much better.

31:14.874 --> 31:15.504
So what?

31:15.644 --> 31:17.804
They saw everything you said.

31:17.804 --> 31:20.474
So, what are you going to do?

31:21.104 --> 31:23.244
Did I say something wrong?

31:23.244 --> 31:24.744
Who are you?

31:25.874 --> 31:26.874
What are you doing?

31:27.874 --> 31:29.744
Are you taking pictures?

31:30.474 --> 31:31.644
Let me see your face.

31:31.974 --> 31:33.644
What are you doing?

31:35.174 --> 31:36.174
Are you crazy?

31:37.004 --> 31:42.204
Illegal parking in a disabled
zone will be fined 100,000 won.

31:42.774 --> 31:43.944
Don't you dare report this!

31:49.974 --> 31:53.484
REPORT FOR ILLEGAL PARKING

32:16.144 --> 32:18.174
Is your sister okay?

32:18.704 --> 32:19.744
You saw?

32:22.274 --> 32:23.274
She's okay.

32:23.474 --> 32:26.604
How about you?

32:27.074 --> 32:30.574
Me? I'm okay.

32:31.304 --> 32:33.774
It happens from time to time...

32:35.944 --> 32:37.274
but...

32:38.144 --> 32:40.874
I can't get used to it.

32:53.044 --> 32:54.104
Enjoy your meal.

33:11.944 --> 33:14.944
The world is so stubborn.

33:17.704 --> 33:21.274
We are just missing sounds.

33:21.874 --> 33:24.404
It's a whole different world.

33:24.404 --> 33:27.774
Can't get in, Can't get out.

33:34.844 --> 33:39.244
It will probably never change.

34:05.804 --> 34:07.444
Why are you here?

34:09.774 --> 34:13.074
Let's go have fun!

34:33.174 --> 34:36.704
It's ok. I will stand.

34:59.504 --> 35:03.044
Can you ask
Ga-eul if she is tired?

35:06.404 --> 35:10.204
Aren't you tired?

35:10.844 --> 35:13.674
I'm excited! Fun is never tiring.

35:14.204 --> 35:18.544
She says fun is never tiring.

35:19.844 --> 35:21.104
Thanks.

35:23.574 --> 35:27.374
Can she miss work, you ask?

35:30.504 --> 35:35.804
Don't you have to go to work?

35:40.374 --> 35:43.274
It's okay. I got a day off.

35:46.044 --> 35:47.604
She's got a day off.

37:26.074 --> 37:27.204
Amazing!

37:37.204 --> 37:38.904
Why here?

39:32.444 --> 39:34.604
Night air feels cool.

39:48.744 --> 39:52.204
I was feeling down today.

39:52.204 --> 39:54.204
Thanks for such a fun time.

39:56.844 --> 39:58.904
Let me head home.

39:58.904 --> 40:01.444
You take your time.

40:02.444 --> 40:03.444
What?

40:17.644 --> 40:19.144
Shall we walk?

41:27.464 --> 41:35.584
HOW MUCH MONEY DID YOU SPEND

41:41.134 --> 41:44.134
DON'T WORRY ABOUT IT. IT'S ON ME

41:47.634 --> 41:50.634
WE HAD FUN TOGETHER.
WE SHOULD ALL PAY

41:51.284 --> 41:54.284
IT'S REALLY OKAY

41:55.834 --> 41:58.834
DON'T SAY THAT. TELL ME HOW MUCH

42:07.124 --> 42:10.124
SORRY. THEN 30,000 WON

42:15.424 --> 42:18.104
GA-EUL TOLD ME TO
SEND YOU 50,000 WON

42:18.604 --> 42:21.604
THANKS. LET'S DO IT AGAIN

42:23.364 --> 42:26.364
SURE, AGAIN!

42:30.244 --> 42:32.344
When did I say that?

42:33.674 --> 42:34.874
You know...

42:36.544 --> 42:39.744
Why do you split money every time?

42:40.374 --> 42:42.474
You can treat him next time.

42:43.544 --> 42:45.304
I don't feel comfortable.

42:47.174 --> 42:48.604
What?

42:49.844 --> 42:51.204
Beer?

43:07.804 --> 43:09.804
Are you dating him?

43:10.574 --> 43:12.374
No. We are just friends.

43:13.674 --> 43:16.444
- I don't think he sees that way.
- We are just friends.

43:45.704 --> 43:46.604
What?

43:46.614 --> 43:48.404
To sleep. So sleepy.

44:04.284 --> 44:07.314
WHAT SOUND DO YOU
WANT TO HEAR THE MOST?

44:18.574 --> 44:26.574
YOUR VOICE...

44:30.274 --> 44:33.704
I DON'T KNOW. I WILL LET YOU KNOW LATER.

44:33.704 --> 44:35.674
YOU MUST BE TIRED. HEAD TO BED.

44:38.904 --> 44:43.004
OKAY. IT WAS SO
MUCH FUN TODAY, NIGHT!

45:03.944 --> 45:05.904
You are going late than usual?

45:06.604 --> 45:08.374
We moved to a
different swimming pool.

45:08.374 --> 45:09.804
Because of that lady?

45:09.804 --> 45:12.404
Yeah. Too many complaints.

45:13.504 --> 45:15.804
That crazy people.

45:15.804 --> 45:17.044
Yeah.

45:17.404 --> 45:20.504
We're not afraid of
poop, we just avoid it.

45:22.304 --> 45:23.874
What are you eating?

45:24.244 --> 45:25.504
Bread!

45:26.904 --> 45:28.874
Where's the new pool?

45:29.304 --> 45:31.844
Old City Swimming Pool.

45:32.504 --> 45:34.204
That's a little far.

45:34.204 --> 45:36.304
I know!

45:37.904 --> 45:39.704
Have a nice day!

45:39.744 --> 45:41.574
You too.

46:00.074 --> 46:02.244
SEOUL SPORT CENTER

46:02.804 --> 46:05.804
- It's so lousy.
- It's lousy.

46:06.844 --> 46:08.844
Of course, I can help.

46:09.144 --> 46:11.344
She's the one I was
telling you about.

46:13.904 --> 46:16.544
- What's her record?
- 28 seconds.

46:16.544 --> 46:17.604
28 seconds?

46:18.204 --> 46:19.944
Will she be competing
in general division?

46:19.974 --> 46:21.704
The upcoming Seoul
City Hall competition?

46:22.174 --> 46:24.244
She will make it to the
qualifiers for National Team

46:24.361 --> 46:25.501
Wow.

46:25.574 --> 46:28.074
Well, let her
practice here freely

46:28.074 --> 46:31.074
Thanks, Right
until the qualifiers.

46:40.844 --> 46:45.504
Let's learn about
international sign language.

47:18.244 --> 47:20.874
I'm hungry. Let's
go home and eat.

47:32.674 --> 47:36.374
25TH SEOUL CITY HALL
SWIMMING COMPETITION

47:38.644 --> 47:39.744
I'll do it.

47:44.574 --> 47:48.104
Lane 2 Kim Su-min,
Gangwon Sports Council.

47:48.404 --> 47:51.574
Lane 3 Woo Hee-yeon,
Halla Athletic.

47:52.574 --> 47:55.644
Lane 4 Joo Hye-reon,
Incheon City Hall.

47:56.604 --> 47:59.444
Lane 5 Jeong Woo-sun,
Stroke Seoul.

48:00.244 --> 48:03.574
Lane 6 Sunwoo Ye-ji,
Gyeongbuk Provincial Office.

48:04.204 --> 48:07.804
Lane 7 Seo Ga-eul,
Hope Swimming Federation.

48:08.374 --> 48:11.674
Lane 8 Ahn Da-hee,
Jeju City Hall.

48:32.774 --> 48:34.104
Take your mark.

49:11.344 --> 49:12.344
She did it!

49:13.304 --> 49:16.104
SEO GA-EUL 27.87 SECONDS

49:16.104 --> 49:19.344
1ST PLACE - SEO GA-EUL/HOPE
SWIMMING FEDERATION - 27.87 SECONDS

49:40.874 --> 49:43.274
Just one more second to go.

49:52.074 --> 49:53.274
What's that?

49:54.044 --> 49:55.604
Gold medal.

49:56.104 --> 49:59.974
Ga-eul beat her personal
best in a general division.

50:00.704 --> 50:03.344
Congratulations!

50:05.504 --> 50:06.904
Wait. Sorry.

50:18.744 --> 50:19.744
Sorry.

50:21.344 --> 50:24.644
If she can reduce
one more second,

50:24.644 --> 50:26.604
she can go to the qualifiers

50:26.604 --> 50:29.504
If she ranks in the qualifiers,
she can be in the national team

50:29.804 --> 50:33.444
Then she can really
go to the Olympics?

50:34.744 --> 50:36.644
Yes. Isn't she amazing?

50:37.204 --> 50:41.974
Yes. You and Ga-eul both!

50:44.074 --> 50:48.404
Shall we celebrate?

50:51.344 --> 50:53.604
Oh... She needs to rest..

50:53.644 --> 50:55.844
And I need to prepare dinner, too.

50:58.674 --> 51:01.404
Congratulations.

51:01.874 --> 51:03.504
Thank you.

51:04.404 --> 51:06.004
You go have fun.

51:07.944 --> 51:10.174
I can see him next time.

51:10.504 --> 51:11.744
Sorry.

51:11.944 --> 51:15.304
Just wait for 30 minutes!

51:15.974 --> 51:19.574
- What took you so long?
- What is it? I'm super busy.

51:19.744 --> 51:22.604
Deliver this, quick.

51:22.644 --> 51:24.274
- No way I'm busy.
- Just this once. Please..

51:24.344 --> 51:25.974
- I'm really busy. I can't
- Just once!

51:26.004 --> 51:28.344
I'm really busy.

51:28.404 --> 51:29.744
I'm sorry, I can't.

51:29.974 --> 51:32.604
- A blind date?
- This is the address?

51:34.504 --> 51:35.744
- Be careful.
- Got it.

51:36.574 --> 51:40.344
This person is really freaky,

51:40.344 --> 51:45.204
so just leave it at the door.

51:45.404 --> 51:46.974
I usually do that anyway.

51:47.044 --> 51:49.044
How freaky?

51:49.074 --> 51:51.144
Worst of the worst.

51:52.204 --> 51:53.674
Just don't encounter.

51:57.474 --> 52:00.074
- Blind date on next Tuesday?
- Just go quick!

52:02.374 --> 52:03.374
I'm going.

52:16.744 --> 52:18.174
Looks good on you.

52:18.674 --> 52:20.074
- Feels strange.
- So pretty.

52:20.474 --> 52:21.744
I like this better.

52:22.244 --> 52:23.644
- It's boring.
- No, it's cool.

52:23.744 --> 52:25.504
- Nah.
- Why?!

52:31.104 --> 52:32.404
Is this ok?

52:32.674 --> 52:34.674
Oh la la.

53:40.674 --> 53:43.904
Why? Something on my face?

53:46.204 --> 53:47.604
No, no.

53:51.774 --> 53:53.844
What should we do?

53:55.904 --> 53:58.174
Are you hungry? Shall we go eat?

53:58.904 --> 54:00.344
Do I...

54:01.904 --> 54:05.774
Look like a hungry monster?

54:07.874 --> 54:10.404
No, no. Why?

54:10.644 --> 54:14.744
You always ask me if I ate.

54:14.744 --> 54:18.644
"Eat something," "Let's eat"

54:20.744 --> 54:22.304
Sorry.

54:23.004 --> 54:26.404
Maybe because I'm
son of the lunchbox shop.

54:27.074 --> 54:29.804
Then, what should we do?

54:32.204 --> 54:35.474
Let's go hang out.

55:14.044 --> 55:16.744
- Isn't here great, right?
- Yes, love it.

55:17.944 --> 55:22.974
Ga-eul and I used to hang
out here when we were kids

55:23.474 --> 55:25.774
Did you live here?

55:27.174 --> 55:29.574
My parents still live here.

55:30.644 --> 55:34.404
I sometimes come
and help my parents.

55:35.604 --> 55:38.904
And I come here
when I feel puzzled.

55:38.904 --> 55:45.704
Gazing at the river helps me clear my mind.

55:49.944 --> 55:53.474
HOW'S YOUR DATE GOING?
NO NEED TO REPLY!

56:06.204 --> 56:08.674
So, what do you desire to do?

56:09.274 --> 56:11.244
- Desire to do?
- Yeah.

56:11.244 --> 56:13.644
My sister going to
the Olympics one day?

56:13.644 --> 56:17.044
Not your sister.
What you really want

56:17.374 --> 56:18.604
Hmm.

56:18.604 --> 56:22.174
Seeing my sister
going to the Olympics?

56:24.544 --> 56:28.404
After that? What do you want to try?

56:29.074 --> 56:30.404
After that?

56:31.904 --> 56:33.004
Me?

56:38.804 --> 56:41.104
Well, I have no idea.

56:41.544 --> 56:46.774
Actually, I've never
thought about what I want.

56:48.674 --> 56:51.204
You really haven't?

56:51.744 --> 56:53.144
Yeah.

56:54.144 --> 56:56.144
How about you?

56:56.144 --> 56:57.344
Me?

57:04.874 --> 57:09.304
I have no idea either, honestly.

57:14.244 --> 57:18.904
As a teenager, I just enjoyed
hanging out with friends

57:19.104 --> 57:24.274
I barely graduated university.

57:24.274 --> 57:28.344
When time came to get a job,
I wasn't sure what I wanted

57:28.744 --> 57:34.074
Still, I submitted some resumes.

57:35.344 --> 57:38.074
Obviously, not a chance!

57:47.444 --> 57:53.204
I have no specialty nor a dream job.

57:55.004 --> 57:56.904
Exactly like me.

57:59.374 --> 58:00.474
Yeah.

58:01.544 --> 58:03.404
Then, how about...

58:03.404 --> 58:06.944
We find something together?

58:07.274 --> 58:08.344
What?

58:09.044 --> 58:10.604
You know...

58:11.204 --> 58:15.544
Neither of us has found our dream yet.

58:16.404 --> 58:21.744
If we try out various
things together.

58:21.974 --> 58:26.374
Maybe we will reach somewhere.

58:26.504 --> 58:27.504
Let's do it!

58:38.644 --> 58:39.844
Yong-jun.

58:45.174 --> 58:50.404
Thanks for being a friend.

01:00:50.504 --> 01:00:52.104
Hello! Anyone there?

01:01:06.104 --> 01:01:07.374
Hey...

01:01:08.974 --> 01:01:13.574
You thanked me for being a friend.

01:01:27.504 --> 01:01:30.104
But I...

01:01:30.104 --> 01:01:31.504
You...

01:01:31.504 --> 01:01:33.644
At first sight.

01:01:37.944 --> 01:01:39.074
Sorry. Hold on.

01:01:49.104 --> 01:01:51.339
HOSPITAL ER NOTIFICATION -
SEO GA-EUL IS TRANSFERRED

01:01:51.363 --> 01:01:54.104
TO THE EMERGENCY ROOM
FOR SUFFOCATION FROM A FIRE

01:02:07.344 --> 01:02:08.344
I'm sorry.

01:02:35.574 --> 01:02:38.674
I inhaled only a bit of smoke.

01:02:40.844 --> 01:02:43.374
Mom and dad will worry.
So don't tell them..

01:02:47.344 --> 01:02:49.304
I am really okay.

01:02:50.404 --> 01:02:52.144
You are not okay!

01:02:52.474 --> 01:02:54.504
It is okay to say not okay.

01:02:54.504 --> 01:02:57.204
You have an important
competition coming up..

01:03:00.144 --> 01:03:02.104
I'm sorry.

01:03:11.244 --> 01:03:13.244
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

01:03:17.144 --> 01:03:19.804
I should have been there for you.

01:03:20.944 --> 01:03:22.944
I'm really okay.

01:03:23.374 --> 01:03:25.144
I shall be discharged soon.

01:03:26.504 --> 01:03:30.704
What if you can't
make it to qualifiers?

01:03:32.244 --> 01:03:38.174
You trained so hard for
10 years in the cold water...

01:03:38.744 --> 01:03:40.944
No,

01:03:41.404 --> 01:03:44.504
I feel warmer and
relaxed in the water now.

01:03:44.544 --> 01:03:46.004
So, don't worry.

01:03:46.044 --> 01:03:50.604
I set a personal best today.
I can rest a bit.

01:04:25.444 --> 01:04:28.274
YONG-JUN :
YEO-REUM, IS EVERYTHING OKAY?

01:05:11.044 --> 01:05:12.504
We will head home now.

01:05:12.504 --> 01:05:13.704
Okay. See you later.

01:05:34.904 --> 01:05:36.874
I CAN GET DISCHARGED

01:05:36.874 --> 01:05:41.804
ALREADY? I'M ON MY WAY

01:05:53.784 --> 01:05:57.407
YOU DON'T NEED TO COME.
COACH IS PICKING ME UP

01:05:57.431 --> 01:05:59.854
I'LL GO STRAIGHT TO PRACTICE

01:06:23.044 --> 01:06:24.442
IF YOU PICKED UP
THIS PHONE,

01:06:24.466 --> 01:06:25.944
PLEASE BRING IT TO
MI-JEONG'S LUNCHBOXES

01:07:05.904 --> 01:07:07.374
Are you okay?

01:07:10.644 --> 01:07:12.974
Should we get something
yummy before going home?

01:07:17.774 --> 01:07:20.074
Go ahead. I have plans.

01:07:25.904 --> 01:07:27.904
Can't I come along, too?

01:07:29.244 --> 01:07:31.004
Why?

01:07:31.504 --> 01:07:33.804
I need to talk with my friends.

01:09:39.044 --> 01:09:42.374
I'M GOING TO PRACTICE, YOU
DON'T HAVE TO COME ANYMORE

01:10:19.274 --> 01:10:21.304
Are you okay?

01:10:25.244 --> 01:10:26.904
What happened?

01:10:29.604 --> 01:10:33.904
Why can't I reach you?
Didn't you see my texts?

01:10:37.504 --> 01:10:38.804
I didn't.

01:10:40.474 --> 01:10:43.574
I'm sorry, but don't come here anymore.

01:10:47.304 --> 01:10:49.604
Stop texting me too.

01:11:05.004 --> 01:11:07.004
Why are you acting like this?

01:11:07.974 --> 01:11:09.744
Did something happen?

01:11:10.544 --> 01:11:12.004
Nothing happened

01:11:12.304 --> 01:11:14.304
Then, did I do something wrong?

01:11:14.674 --> 01:11:16.004
No.

01:11:16.644 --> 01:11:18.774
Then, why?

01:11:18.774 --> 01:11:21.304
Tell me. I need to know..

01:11:21.304 --> 01:11:23.144
You don't have to know!

01:11:29.704 --> 01:11:33.544
Do you know how worried I was?

01:11:34.044 --> 01:11:36.704
If you do this again to
me, what should I do?

01:11:41.544 --> 01:11:44.174
How can you not think
about my feelings?

01:11:45.404 --> 01:11:48.074
Do I have to care
about your feelings too?

01:11:49.844 --> 01:11:53.104
I barely can take care
of those around me.

01:11:57.144 --> 01:12:00.304
Please, just go.

01:12:02.974 --> 01:12:04.644
Do I...

01:12:07.674 --> 01:12:09.704
Am I

01:12:11.404 --> 01:12:12.604
a burden to you?

01:13:08.044 --> 01:13:10.344
Hope he will do deliveries.

01:13:14.019 --> 01:13:16.009
- You do it.
- Me?

01:13:19.604 --> 01:13:20.544
Go quick.

01:13:20.544 --> 01:13:21.774
Is that for delivery?

01:13:23.104 --> 01:13:24.104
- I will go.
- Sure.

01:13:29.644 --> 01:13:30.704
He's alright.

01:14:56.644 --> 01:14:58.344
It's over.

01:14:58.704 --> 01:15:01.044
I can't make it to qualifiers.

01:15:03.544 --> 01:15:05.004
I'm sorry.

01:15:12.904 --> 01:15:15.344
Ga-eul, I'm sorry.

01:15:17.804 --> 01:15:19.404
It's my fault.

01:15:20.474 --> 01:15:23.204
Because of me, your dream...

01:15:23.474 --> 01:15:25.974
What about your dream?

01:15:29.404 --> 01:15:32.004
What is your dream?

01:15:33.944 --> 01:15:38.044
Do you only care about my dream?

01:15:40.374 --> 01:15:43.344
Your dream is my dream.

01:15:44.104 --> 01:15:46.644
Why is my dream your dream?

01:15:47.274 --> 01:15:50.044
My life is mine to live.

01:15:50.044 --> 01:15:53.874
Why do you stake
your life for my dream?

01:15:54.174 --> 01:15:57.404
What do you mean?
Why do you say that?

01:15:58.144 --> 01:16:00.004
Don't you understand?

01:16:02.674 --> 01:16:04.904
You take me here
back and forth every day.

01:16:04.904 --> 01:16:07.804
You do jobs to pay
for my training fees.

01:16:07.804 --> 01:16:11.474
You spend all your
hours at the pool.

01:16:15.274 --> 01:16:20.244
Is your life here?

01:16:23.444 --> 01:16:26.244
You are here solely because of me.

01:16:27.774 --> 01:16:33.144
Do you know how
that makes me feel?

01:16:37.904 --> 01:16:40.674
I'm drifting away...

01:16:41.974 --> 01:16:43.544
Me...

01:16:44.374 --> 01:16:47.604
My life... My dream!

01:16:50.504 --> 01:16:54.144
I can't rest when I want to

01:16:54.144 --> 01:17:00.044
I can't quit even if I want to.

01:17:00.974 --> 01:17:04.244
Rather than not
reaching to the qualifiers.

01:17:07.944 --> 01:17:12.274
It hurts more to disappoint you.

01:17:14.644 --> 01:17:17.374
It's too hard feeling
sorry all the time.

01:18:06.274 --> 01:18:07.274
Hey yo!

01:18:08.474 --> 01:18:11.844
What's wrong?
Something happened?

01:18:24.674 --> 01:18:26.374
That delivery you asked me to do?

01:18:27.374 --> 01:18:30.991
Wasn't it your girlfriend's house?

01:18:31.015 --> 01:18:32.802
Who's the freaky person?

01:18:34.174 --> 01:18:36.874
Did you see him?

01:18:37.804 --> 01:18:40.174
Nah, I just left the food
at the door and left.

01:18:41.244 --> 01:18:43.374
Who is it?

01:18:43.744 --> 01:18:45.074
Her younger brother.

01:18:46.304 --> 01:18:47.704
Younger brother?

01:18:48.404 --> 01:18:50.804
Oh, that freaky person was
her younger brother.

01:18:52.944 --> 01:18:54.244
That must have been tough for you.

01:18:57.444 --> 01:18:58.874
Whatever.

01:19:01.844 --> 01:19:04.144
It's all over now.

01:19:05.544 --> 01:19:06.544
What are you saying?

01:19:07.304 --> 01:19:08.304
I got dumped.

01:19:11.074 --> 01:19:12.304
No, that can't be.

01:19:13.204 --> 01:19:14.574
It's over.

01:19:17.774 --> 01:19:21.774
It's not over until it's over.

01:19:21.874 --> 01:19:24.204
What? It's over, so it's over.

01:19:24.204 --> 01:19:27.144
Call her and say you are sorry.

01:19:27.504 --> 01:19:33.380
Say everything in the world is your fault.

01:19:33.774 --> 01:19:35.174
I can't do that.

01:19:35.174 --> 01:19:38.204
Why not? Just call her.

01:19:38.604 --> 01:19:40.204
Just do it once for me.

01:19:41.774 --> 01:19:43.604
Come on.

01:19:44.174 --> 01:19:45.474
She's hearing impaired.

01:19:48.244 --> 01:19:55.404
She told me not to come nor text.

01:19:59.944 --> 01:20:01.004
I see.

01:20:06.044 --> 01:20:07.704
I didn't know that.

01:20:11.604 --> 01:20:13.474
It must have been
really tough for you, man.

01:20:16.874 --> 01:20:18.988
Hey, man. Do you know...

01:20:19.013 --> 01:20:21.561
If the freaky younger
brother is also...

01:20:24.656 --> 01:20:26.893
the same?

01:20:28.656 --> 01:20:29.580
Yes.

01:20:50.304 --> 01:20:52.144
Is something wrong?

01:20:53.044 --> 01:20:55.044
No, nothing's wrong

01:20:55.044 --> 01:20:58.174
Ga-eul is training
and eating well.

01:20:58.174 --> 01:21:00.874
No, I'm asking about you.

01:21:08.744 --> 01:21:10.804
Mom. Dad.

01:21:12.074 --> 01:21:14.474
Why did you bring
me into this world?

01:21:14.904 --> 01:21:17.374
Because, it's you!

01:21:17.744 --> 01:21:19.144
Of course.

01:21:21.344 --> 01:21:23.274
When you had me,

01:21:23.774 --> 01:21:27.674
weren't you afraid
of the disability?

01:21:28.044 --> 01:21:30.504
Why would we be afraid?

01:21:30.504 --> 01:21:33.544
Because it's hard.

01:21:33.904 --> 01:21:35.974
It's not hard.

01:21:35.974 --> 01:21:37.544
Was it hard for you?

01:21:37.544 --> 01:21:39.804
No way. Not at all.

01:21:59.644 --> 01:22:02.944
My son got dumped

01:22:07.744 --> 01:22:08.904
I thought so.

01:22:09.904 --> 01:22:11.174
You can tell?

01:22:11.571 --> 01:22:12.304
Very.

01:22:12.744 --> 01:22:16.474
Which girl broke my boy's heart?

01:22:20.504 --> 01:22:21.504
For her...

01:22:30.344 --> 01:22:32.404
Her younger sister
is everything to her.

01:22:33.804 --> 01:22:35.644
Does a lot of part-time jobs

01:22:36.944 --> 01:22:41.604
diligently living person.

01:22:44.144 --> 01:22:46.144
Even having no time to eat.

01:22:50.330 --> 01:22:51.606
She...

01:22:52.910 --> 01:22:58.349
She have never thought
of what she desires to do.

01:22:58.374 --> 01:22:59.374
Why?

01:23:02.304 --> 01:23:03.404
She's too kind.

01:23:06.404 --> 01:23:12.104
Always take care of others but herself.

01:23:14.744 --> 01:23:18.744
I think that's why she dumped me.

01:23:21.344 --> 01:23:22.904
Not to hurt me.

01:23:24.004 --> 01:23:25.204
Why should it hurt?

01:23:26.974 --> 01:23:27.974
She can't hear.

01:23:28.774 --> 01:23:29.545
Huh?

01:23:30.644 --> 01:23:32.424
Hearing impaired.

01:23:33.215 --> 01:23:34.511
Can't speak either.

01:23:36.704 --> 01:23:38.074
Mom.

01:23:40.144 --> 01:23:45.204
I feel like you don't.
want me here to help you.

01:23:46.174 --> 01:23:47.844
Right.

01:23:48.374 --> 01:23:49.944
Why?

01:23:49.944 --> 01:23:51.844
It's nice to have help.

01:23:52.044 --> 01:23:54.074
It is, but.

01:23:54.074 --> 01:23:59.604
It's a burden seeing
you only care for others.

01:24:00.974 --> 01:24:06.274
But still, I'm useful
around here, right?

01:24:06.644 --> 01:24:08.744
Do you know what
you are really doing?

01:24:10.044 --> 01:24:11.744
Being a good daughter?

01:24:12.374 --> 01:24:13.744
No.

01:24:14.204 --> 01:24:15.304
What is it, then?

01:24:17.144 --> 01:24:21.404
S-Y-M-P-A-T-H-I-Z-I-N-G

01:24:26.644 --> 01:24:28.644
Why do you say that?

01:24:29.044 --> 01:24:33.844
I'm just looking
out for my family.

01:24:34.604 --> 01:24:36.204
I know, but.

01:24:36.204 --> 01:24:41.344
No one can live someone
else's life for them.

01:24:42.144 --> 01:24:47.644
Family trusts each other and wait.

01:24:48.744 --> 01:24:54.574
I want you to help
when we ask you to.

01:24:56.744 --> 01:24:58.244
I'm sorry.

01:24:59.574 --> 01:25:02.244
Mom, I...

01:25:03.044 --> 01:25:04.144
It's okay, Yeo-reum.

01:25:06.704 --> 01:25:13.044
I want my daughter
to live her life.

01:25:14.604 --> 01:25:19.074
Not as Ga-eul's
sister nor our daughter.

01:25:19.404 --> 01:25:21.844
Just as you.

01:25:45.004 --> 01:25:47.404
 - I'm sorry.

01:25:45.004 --> 01:25:47.404
 - I'm sorry.

01:26:01.544 --> 01:26:03.704
Looks like summer
birds aren't back yet

01:26:03.704 --> 01:26:04.974
I guess so

01:26:04.974 --> 01:26:07.774
I don't see any of it.

01:26:10.374 --> 01:26:13.074
I wanted to see them.

01:26:27.974 --> 01:26:31.004
Why aren't you seeing that guy?

01:26:32.904 --> 01:26:35.344
I don't want to date anyone.

01:26:36.144 --> 01:26:37.444
Why?

01:26:38.104 --> 01:26:40.074
Because of hearing impaired?

01:26:42.074 --> 01:26:44.144
Because of me?

01:26:46.444 --> 01:26:49.504
I don't want to be
a burden to you.

01:26:49.544 --> 01:26:52.774
You are never a burden to me.
I mean it.

01:26:54.504 --> 01:26:59.574
I want to see you
smiling like this.

01:26:59.574 --> 01:27:01.444
Your smile makes me happy.

01:27:03.174 --> 01:27:07.004
In the water, you smile like that.

01:27:07.304 --> 01:27:10.604
Then, can't you just trust me?

01:27:12.504 --> 01:27:15.844
I will start over, and
I can do it by myself.

01:27:17.304 --> 01:27:19.004
Okay, I trust you.

01:27:19.544 --> 01:27:21.604
Then, go date him.

01:27:21.604 --> 01:27:25.044
You are afraid about not being by his
side since you need to take care of me

01:27:27.304 --> 01:27:30.804
I won't give up swimming.

01:27:31.744 --> 01:27:34.104
So don't give up on him too.

01:27:43.074 --> 01:27:44.874
What's up with Yong-jun?

01:27:45.074 --> 01:27:46.204
Is he dumped?

01:27:48.191 --> 01:27:48.951
Yeah.

01:27:49.104 --> 01:27:51.074
No way.

01:27:51.404 --> 01:27:52.874
Should I...?

01:27:53.874 --> 01:27:55.174
She can't hear.

01:27:55.744 --> 01:27:56.744
She can't hear.

01:27:56.774 --> 01:27:57.844
You mean with her ears?

01:27:57.844 --> 01:28:00.504
Then what?
You hear with your nose?

01:28:00.504 --> 01:28:01.504
With nose?

01:28:04.244 --> 01:28:06.104
She is hearing impaired.

01:28:06.804 --> 01:28:09.174
She can't hear and speak.

01:28:12.374 --> 01:28:13.674
That's why she dumped him.

01:28:14.044 --> 01:28:15.674
She didn't want to drag him down.

01:28:18.204 --> 01:28:21.544
Should I go talk to her?

01:28:23.104 --> 01:28:26.004
Are you okay with it?

01:28:26.474 --> 01:28:27.474
With what?

01:28:29.944 --> 01:28:31.374
She being deaf.

01:28:32.004 --> 01:28:33.174
What about it?

01:28:34.144 --> 01:28:35.674
I'm okay as long as
she's a good person.

01:28:35.674 --> 01:28:40.244
Being able to hear and speak doesn't
mean they know how to communicate

01:28:48.644 --> 01:28:49.774
Right.

01:28:50.174 --> 01:28:53.504
This is why I fell
in love with you.

01:28:54.874 --> 01:28:55.974
Fell in what?

01:28:56.504 --> 01:28:57.744
Yeah, here's an example.

01:28:58.093 --> 01:28:59.863
What are you saying?

01:33:27.704 --> 01:33:29.204
I'm sorry, Yeo-reum.

01:33:33.404 --> 01:33:35.404
I'm sorry for saying sorry

01:33:38.144 --> 01:33:41.804
I'm sorry because

01:33:42.774 --> 01:33:45.804
because I didn't really know.

01:33:48.204 --> 01:33:53.274
I thought I knew

01:33:55.804 --> 01:33:57.204
but I didn't.

01:33:59.204 --> 01:34:00.404
That's...

01:34:02.504 --> 01:34:03.604
why I'm sorry.

01:34:04.804 --> 01:34:06.204
And I...

01:34:06.904 --> 01:34:10.274
Didn't know I might
be a burden to you.

01:34:11.804 --> 01:34:13.304
That I'm sorry, too.

01:34:19.044 --> 01:34:20.204
That's why...

01:34:22.874 --> 01:34:28.344
We drifted apart a little bit.

01:34:30.474 --> 01:34:32.604
In fact, I got dumped.

01:34:38.144 --> 01:34:39.144
But...

01:34:41.244 --> 01:34:44.004
I can not let you go.

01:34:45.004 --> 01:34:47.104
I won't let you go.

01:34:49.104 --> 01:34:51.344
You don't take care of yourself,

01:34:51.504 --> 01:34:54.044
so I want to take care of you.

01:34:59.644 --> 01:35:00.644
Also...

01:35:02.574 --> 01:35:05.304
I like your smile,

01:35:05.374 --> 01:35:08.244
and I want to make you

01:35:11.644 --> 01:35:12.644
Smile.

01:35:18.204 --> 01:35:21.744
So, what I wanted to say is...

01:35:23.404 --> 01:35:25.804
That... I...

01:36:45.044 --> 01:36:46.874
Do you

01:36:47.174 --> 01:36:49.304
want to work

01:36:49.304 --> 01:36:55.204
at my parents' store?

01:36:56.874 --> 01:36:58.744
Why?

01:36:59.274 --> 01:37:03.804
I think it would be
fun to work together.

01:37:05.504 --> 01:37:08.074
I can't hear.

01:37:10.304 --> 01:37:12.944
Would your parents
be okay with that?

01:37:14.874 --> 01:37:17.874
They will see.

01:37:19.104 --> 01:37:25.404
How good a person you are!

01:37:26.544 --> 01:37:30.644
How hard you work!

01:37:45.204 --> 01:37:46.644
Yes?

01:37:46.974 --> 01:37:48.304
Yes.

01:38:21.204 --> 01:38:22.474
Come in, please.

01:38:25.304 --> 01:38:27.144
Please, have a seat.

01:38:29.004 --> 01:38:32.344
She's so pretty.

01:38:37.304 --> 01:38:40.474
Mom, dad, this is Yeo-reum.

01:38:41.304 --> 01:38:43.404
And her sign name is this.

01:38:44.604 --> 01:38:46.304
Because, she smiles a lot.

01:38:49.774 --> 01:38:52.727
Oh I forgot. That thing?

01:38:53.944 --> 01:38:55.474
Look here.

01:38:55.804 --> 01:38:58.074
I'm Yong-jun's dad.

01:38:58.904 --> 01:39:01.474
I'm Yong-jun's mom.

01:39:02.804 --> 01:39:05.574
Nice to meet you.

01:39:07.544 --> 01:39:13.044
Yong-jun is childish and a bit Idiotic.

01:39:13.174 --> 01:39:14.174
Mom.

01:39:14.174 --> 01:39:18.114
He can be dense and
clueless sometimes.

01:39:19.444 --> 01:39:22.344
But, he is also a
very reliable person.

01:39:23.774 --> 01:39:26.174
Yong-jun eats a lot

01:39:26.374 --> 01:39:28.374
and poops a lot.

01:39:28.644 --> 01:39:29.674
Stop it.

01:39:32.944 --> 01:39:38.074
Why don't you two get back together?

01:39:41.174 --> 01:39:43.444
Why do you ask her that?

01:39:43.444 --> 01:39:45.544
She's here for a job interview.

01:39:45.544 --> 01:39:47.219
You can work and
date at the same time

01:39:47.243 --> 01:39:49.204
Or be a working honey bees.

01:39:50.274 --> 01:39:51.374
Yes, I'd like that.

01:40:03.104 --> 01:40:06.144
I said I'd like that.

01:40:08.744 --> 01:40:10.474
She can speak!

01:40:11.204 --> 01:40:13.390
- She speaks!
- Uh-uh?

01:40:15.374 --> 01:40:18.404
I thought you can't hear?

01:40:19.204 --> 01:40:23.444
I can. I thought you can't hear.

01:40:32.204 --> 01:40:37.644
So you heard what
I said at the pool?

01:40:40.574 --> 01:40:41.774
You heard it...

01:40:46.374 --> 01:40:50.804
So, yes to getting back

01:40:52.804 --> 01:40:53.904
with me?

01:40:55.574 --> 01:40:58.874
Or getting the job?

01:41:08.304 --> 01:41:09.504
I...

01:41:12.304 --> 01:41:14.674
like you.

01:41:15.544 --> 01:41:17.830
- What did she say?
- Be quiet.

01:41:25.204 --> 01:41:27.674
What did she say?

01:41:27.804 --> 01:41:29.304
Stop asking!

01:41:30.544 --> 01:41:31.974
She made this sign.

01:41:46.357 --> 01:41:48.804
I was fooled by my
senior in university.

01:41:49.704 --> 01:41:50.491
Huh?

01:41:52.504 --> 01:41:56.874
He said that sign
language is a body language

01:41:57.144 --> 01:42:00.044
that can be used
anywhere in the world.

01:42:00.204 --> 01:42:03.774
So, I must learn if I
plan to go backpacking.

01:42:05.874 --> 01:42:08.074
That's it?

01:42:08.074 --> 01:42:09.604
That's why I learned it.

01:42:10.004 --> 01:42:11.204
Just because of that?

01:42:23.544 --> 01:42:25.074
So...

01:42:26.844 --> 01:42:30.104
Among your family...

01:42:31.804 --> 01:42:33.644
Only you can hear?

01:42:35.204 --> 01:42:36.244
Yes.

01:42:40.774 --> 01:42:45.504
I thought everyone was like that.

01:42:48.044 --> 01:42:49.404
But, I was wrong.

01:42:50.744 --> 01:42:54.474
Only my family was
living in a different world.

01:42:54.604 --> 01:42:58.444
Don't act and live as if you are
also hearing-impaired like us.

01:42:59.074 --> 01:43:07.874
You're different from us, but
you are not in a different world.

01:43:08.304 --> 01:43:10.544
We share the world
called 'family' together.

01:43:10.544 --> 01:43:12.204
Hear me?

01:43:19.504 --> 01:43:23.574
For us, meeting you girls...

01:43:23.574 --> 01:43:27.444
Is the best thing that
happened in our lives.

01:43:34.674 --> 01:43:35.904
For me...

01:43:37.044 --> 01:43:39.274
being born as your daughter

01:43:41.404 --> 01:43:43.944
is the best thing that happened in my life.

01:43:49.144 --> 01:43:50.404
For me...

01:43:52.804 --> 01:43:54.434
meeting you

01:43:54.834 --> 01:43:56.644
is the best thing that

01:43:58.804 --> 01:44:00.704
happened in my life.

01:44:40.104 --> 01:44:42.904
DIRECTED AND ADAPTED BY JO SEON HO

