HONG KYUNG

01:44:46.154 --> 01:44:48.824
ROH YOON-SEO

01:44:49.154 --> 01:44:51.884
KIM MIN-JU

01:44:52.204 --> 01:44:54.984
JUNG HYE-YOUNG / HYUN BONG-SIK / JUNG YONG-JU

01:45:16.144 --> 01:45:18.044
Are you alright?

01:45:19.704 --> 01:45:21.044
Hold tight!

01:45:45.904 --> 01:45:47.304
I like you.
